    "tagline": "To unfold a polyhedron",
    "bio": {
      "en": "I’m Xin (Robynn) Shen. I work in photography and creative direction, and I also like experimenting with sound, code, and interaction. Sometimes it starts with a camera, sometimes with an idea, and sometimes with me wondering, “what if I try this?” This is where those experiments end up.",
      "zh": "我是沈芯 Robynn。我的创作会在摄影、创意指导和互动媒体之间切换，也常常顺着兴趣碰到文化、声音和代码。\n有时候从一台相机开始，有时候从一个想法开始，也有时候只是因为我突然想：“这个要不试试看？”\n这里就是这些尝试最后聚在一起的地方。"
